{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日5/2は、2ndシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おいでシャンプー」発売日！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよですね＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は一足先にフラゲしちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで一生懸命作り上げて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも素敵な作品になってると思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、みなさんにぜひ見てほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーは今までダンスバージョンのPVしか公開になってませんでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技バージョンも収録されています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは33人の個人PVもあります☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のコンセプトは「デート」です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと恥ずかしいですが、よかったら見てくれたらうれしいです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"o(^-^)oワクワク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから今日は、PON！に生出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/8457147/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送時間は10：25〜11：25です